<p class="muted">Net hours deduct only the remaining scheduled weekday break after recorded gaps during 08:00–17:30. Open sessions are incomplete. Mon–Fri: 08:00–17:30 normal hours; recorded work after 17:30 is weekday OT. Sat/Sun: flexible hours, no late time; first 8 worked hours per work date are Single OT, remaining hours are Double OT. Weekend time has no automatic scheduled-break deduction. Open workdays are excluded from finalized OT totals.</p>
